/**
 * Golden fixtures from Ethereum mainnet, captured 2026-09-19 at the three
 * keepers#27 incident blocks (13:45 / 13:50 / 13:55 UTC), via eth_call
 * archive reads. Every `value` is the chain-verbatim raw return data; nothing
 * here is re-encoded by the function under test or by its own encoder.
 *
 * On-chain truth at these blocks: checker() fires Rebalance (action 1) while
 * every selected (!paused && !isHealthy()) strategy is not calm, so each
 * relayed batch reverted UniCLStratNotCalm on-chain:
 *   26004768 — S2 unhealthy (1 revert)
 *   26004793 — S1, S2, S3 unhealthy (3 reverts)
 *   26004820 — S1, S3 unhealthy (2 reverts)
 */
